<title>HONG KONG: General Accident opens Guangzhou office.</title>
<headline>General Accident opens Guangzhou office.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>International insurance company General Accident Plc said on Thursday it opened a representative office in Guangzhou in southern China.</p>
<p>It also has offices in China's Beijing and Shanghai.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
